  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "A point source of light is placed at the centre of curvature of a hemispherical surface. The source emits a power of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>24</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math>.&nbsp;The radius of curvature of hemisphere is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> and the inner surface is completely reflecting. The force on the hemisphere due to the light falling on it is ______&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f77b1650-ffae-4a1f-a758-ae0c0b177a27-9895767.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 243px;\" /></p><p>For completely reflecting surface, force,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mi>c</mi></mfrac></math>, where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>Surface</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>area</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is intensity of radiation,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is surface area and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;is speed of light.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi></mrow><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>c</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>24</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
